### 1. Crear usuario (201) — el rol del body se ignora
POST http://localhost:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana Pérez", "email": "ANA@mail.com", "password": "clave12345", "rol": "admin" }

### 2. Mismo email (409 EMAIL_DUPLICATED)
POST http://localhost:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana 2", "email": "ana@mail.com", "password": "clave12345" }

### 3. Body inválido (400, con 3 errores en details)
POST http://localhost:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "A", "email": "no-es-email", "password": "123" }

### 4. Listar (200)
GET http://localhost:8000/users

### 5. Obtener uno (200)
GET http://localhost:8000/users/1

### 6. Inexistente (404 USER_NOT_FOUND)
GET http://localhost:8000/users/99

### 7. ID inválido (400)
GET http://localhost:8000/users/abc

### 8. Actualizar nombre (200)
PUT http://localhost:8000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana María" }

### 9. Actualizar con body vacío (400)
PUT http://localhost:8000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 10. Eliminar (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/users/1